 gymnasium while a voiceover introduces him as Adam McGhee from Texas Basketball watching Texas Television, accompanied by a low-frequency hum and faint ambient noise.\nThe video opens with a black screen, transitions to a \"rivals YAHOO! SPORTS\" logo animation featuring a metallic mesh background and blue lens flares, then displays a \"TEXAS HOOPS TELEVISION\" graphic with a basketball breaking through a TV screen, followed by a young man in a black basketball jersey with a medal speaking in a gymnasium while a voiceover introduces him as Adam McGhee from Texas Basketball watching Texas Television, accompanied by a low-frequency hum and faint ambient noise.\n\n\\boxed{rivals YAHOO! SPORTS logo animation with blue lens flares over metallic mesh background, Texas Hoops Television graphic with basketball breaking TV screen, young man in black jersey with medal speaking in gymnasium while voiceover introduces him as Adam McGhee from Texas Basketball watching Texas Television, accompanied by low-frequency hum and faint ambient noise}", "time_sec": 289.676, "generation_time_seconds": 287.6797, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0347, "nemotron": {"method": "pd", "step_beam_size": 1, "num_rollout": 4, "num_foresight": 3, "cluster_num": 2, "sigma_rate": 1.0, "runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code"}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
